  "body": "Lot 55 / 20 Melia Place, Stanmore Bay - Price Slashed - Vendor Says Sell! New Standalone Home - Stanmore Bay\r\n\r\nDiscover Precise on Melia - a boutique coastal community in the heart of Stanmore Bay. Presents a brand-new standalone freehold home designed for modern living. With 3 bedrooms + 2.5 bathrooms, and a peaceful setting beside a natural walking track, this home offers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience, and relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nLocated within the sought-after Precise on Melia development, residents enjoy exclusive community amenities including a Party House, children's playground, multi-purpose sports court, and BBQ area. Scenic walkways and nearby beaches create a lifestyle where everyday living feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n* Brand new standalone freehold house - no shared walls\r\n* 3 bedrooms (including 1 master suite) + 2.5 bathrooms \r\n* Open-plan kitchen with quality appliances and practical flow\r\n* Low-maintenance garden and private deck\r\n* The backyard backs directly onto a walkway, with no rear neighbours, offering excellent privacy.\r\n* Comes with 2 dedicated parking spaces for your exclusive use.\r\n* Backs onto a peaceful bush walking track\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n* Approx. 7 minutes to Silverdale Mall \r\n* Around 10 minutes to motorway access for an easy commute\r\n* Multiple beautiful beaches within 10 minutes' drive \r\n* Approx. 10 minutes to the upcoming Penlink, providing faster access to Albany and Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nEducation options nearby include:\r\n* Red Beach School\r\n* Stanmore Bay School\r\n* Wentworth College\r\n* Wentworth Primary School\r\n\r\nHere, the ideal lifestyle is simple: live where every day feels like a getaway. Precise on Melia also offers other options to suit different needs, including stylish 2-3 bedroom townhouses and spacious 4-bedroom family homes.\r\n\r\nContact Vicky today to find the home that fits your lifestyle.",
